  {
   "uuid": "183ca666-da3b-4186-a045-b3f14932fbfd",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.heading",
   "parent_uuid": "49db1e31-dd8b-4c88-9e0c-2f7adece2124",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "text": "By car or taxi",
    "level": "h2",
    "id": "car-title",
    "size": "sm"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "193a76f8-f79e-413a-bf6d-69b73e368a4c",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.prose",
   "parent_uuid": "49db1e31-dd8b-4c88-9e0c-2f7adece2124",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "<p>Follow signs for Meridian Airport from the A45. For sat-nav, use B99 1MA, then follow the road signs for Terminal 1 or Terminal 2.</p>\n<p>Lane closures on the A45 approach are in place until 12 October. Allow an extra 15 minutes to reach Terminal 2.</p>\n<h3>Drop-off</h3>\n<p>Drop-off zones are outside both terminals. They cost £3 for up to 10 minutes. For free drop-off, use the 10-minute zone at the Mid-Stay car park and take the shuttle bus to the terminal.</p>\n<h3>Pick-up</h3>\n<p>Park in P1 Short-stay for a quick pick-up, from £4 an hour. Or wait for free for 10 minutes at Mid-Stay.</p>\n<h3>Taxis</h3>\n<p>There are taxi ranks outside the arrivals halls of both terminals, open 24 hours. Pre-booked taxis and private hire cars pick up from level 0 of P2 Long-stay.</p>"
   }
  },
