   "parent_uuid": "8c4732d5-864e-4410-be0e-eac9892d6e5a",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "text": "By bus or coach",
    "level": "h2",
    "id": "bus-title",
    "size": "sm"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "04cac0b5-8a35-4912-98c2-15bc8e07abf0",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.prose",
   "parent_uuid": "8c4732d5-864e-4410-be0e-eac9892d6e5a",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "<h3>Local buses</h3>\n<p>The Meridian Link bus runs between the city centre and both terminals every 20 minutes, from 05:00 to 23:30. The journey takes about 35 minutes. Stops are outside the arrivals halls. Pay the driver by card or phone.</p>\n<h3>Coaches</h3>\n<p>The coach station is next to Terminal 2, with direct coaches to towns and cities across the country. Book with the coach operator. The coach station has a waiting room, toilets and a ticket machine, open from 04:00 to midnight.</p>"
   }
